WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.484
In an instant Roxy changed into Rocket Girl.

2
00:00:07.485 --> 00:00:11.237
"It's time to find that art thief!" said Roxy.

3
00:00:11.238 --> 00:00:17.103
She blasted up into the sky.

4
00:00:17.104 --> 00:00:22.068
When Roxy arrived at the Metro City Art Gallery, she laughed.

5
00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:25.292
Detective Smith was crawling around on the floor.

6
00:00:25.293 --> 00:00:28.944
"Uh, Detective," Roxy asked with a grin.

7
00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:33.553
"Aren't you a little old to be playing on the floor?"

8
00:00:33.554 --> 00:00:36.808
Detective Smith frowned as he stood up.

9
00:00:36.809 --> 00:00:40.401
"I wasn't playing on the floor," he said.

10
00:00:40.402 --> 00:00:42.489
"I was looking at this."

11
00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:46.214
Detective Smith held up a ball about the size of a baseball.

12
00:00:46.215 --> 00:00:48.979
It had a small lightning bolt on one side.

13
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.920
On the other side was the word "fog."

14
00:00:51.921 --> 00:00:56.920
"Aha!" said Roxy. "That ball belongs to Weatherman!"

15
00:00:56.921 --> 00:01:00.277
"You're right!" said Detective Smith.

16
00:01:00.278 --> 00:01:06.353
"He uses Weather Balls to create bad weather.

17
00:01:06.354 --> 00:01:08.204
I talked to a witness.

18
00:01:08.205 --> 00:01:12.772
She said the art gallery was filled with fog during the robbery."

19
00:01:12.773 --> 00:01:15.406
"Hmm," said Roxy.

20
00:01:15.407 --> 00:01:18.796
"So no one could see who was stealing the paintings."

21
00:01:18.797 --> 00:01:21.815
"Exactly!" said Detective Smith.

22
00:01:21.816 --> 00:01:24.169
Just then his phone rang.

23
00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:29.948
"Hello?" he said. "Good! Don't lose him!"

24
00:01:29.949 --> 00:01:33.195
Detective Smith hung up his phone and looked at Roxy.

25
00:01:33.196 --> 00:01:36.667
"Police found Weatherman driving down West Street. They're

26
00:01:36.668 --> 00:01:38.882
chasing him now." Without

27
00:01:38.883 --> 00:01:43.510
saying a word, Roxy flew out of the gallery. On

28
00:01:43.511 --> 00:01:47.316
West Street three police cars were chasing a black van. Two

29
00:01:47.317 --> 00:01:56.232
lightning bolts were painted on the van's sides. Suddenly

30
00:01:56.233 --> 00:02:00.339
a thick fog filled the street. The

31
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:04.718
police lost sight of the van, which darted down an alley. "More

32
00:02:04.719 --> 00:02:07.525
fog, huh?" said Roxy. "That's

33
00:02:07.526 --> 00:02:10.941
not a problem for Rocket Girl!" Roxy

34
00:02:10.942 --> 00:02:14.462
took a deep breath and blew as hard as she could. The

35
00:02:14.463 --> 00:02:16.620
fog cleared instantly. Now

36
00:02:16.621 --> 00:02:20.403
Roxy could see Weatherman's van a few blocks away. She

37
00:02:20.404 --> 00:02:23.890
flew after it. Whiz-hoo!

38
00:02:23.891 --> 00:02:25.417
Roxy

39
00:02:25.418 --> 00:02:31.030
fired her eye laser beams, burning a hole in the back of the van. The

40
00:02:31.031 --> 00:02:35.811
van skidded to a stop, and Weatherman jumped out. "You

41
00:02:35.812 --> 00:02:40.068
ruined the Weather Van!" he yelled. "You're

42
00:02:40.069 --> 00:02:44.738
going to pay for that, Rocket Girl!" Weatherman

43
00:02:44.739 --> 00:02:49.344
grabbed a Weather Ball from the back of the van. He

44
00:02:49.345 --> 00:02:51.316
threw it into the air. "Weather

45
00:02:51.317 --> 00:02:58.566
Ball, activate!" The

46
00:02:58.567 --> 00:03:02.753
whole sky grew dark. Clouds moved in. And

47
00:03:02.754 --> 00:03:04.699
then— crack!

48
00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.821
A giant lightning bolt shot down from the sky.

49
00:03:07.822 --> 00:03:13.253
And it was headed straight toward Roxy!

